    "44": "Septober 23:",
    "45": "Our messenger returned",
    "46": "with the books I asked for",
    "47": "and a letter from Elissa. It is",
    "48": "unfortunate that the museum",
    "49": "will not be able to finance a",
    "50": "full-scale excavation here as",
    "51": "well as the one closer to",
    "52": "Varrock, although I am of",
    "53": "course pleased that the other",
    "54": "city has been uncovered. But",
    "55": "with the books I am able to",
    "56": "piece together more of the",
    "57": "story of this city.",
    "58": "",
    "60": "The unidentified symbol in",
    "61": "the ruins is that of the",
    "62": "demon Thammaron, who was",
    "63": "Zamorak's chief lieutenant",
    "64": "during the godwars of the",
    "65": "Third Age. With that",
    "66": "information I can say with",
    "67": "confidence that these are the",
    "68": "ruins of Uzer, an advanced",
    "69": "human civilization said to have",
